
### CoWorkHub API Testing
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Check backend - Get all members
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/members
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Get all resources
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/resources
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Get available resources
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/resources/available
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Get all bookings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Get bookings for a specific member
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/members/1/bookings
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Create a new member
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
    
}

###

### 7. Create a new booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
    
}

###

### 8. Create a room
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/resources/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
    
}

###

### 9. Create a desk
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/resources/desks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    
}

###

### 10. Update a booking
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    
}

###

### 11. Update a resource
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/resources/1
Content-Type: application/json

